{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9dc496df-2dc5-88f6-8426-ef2f8bd67911",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T13:00:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Margaret Sherman. I am calling about my water and sewer bill. Sorry, I am in the car, maybe the sound is bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you okay. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to change the mailing address. Bill go to old address, my mother house, and I did not get it again. Now I have to call. This is annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a hassle, I'm sorry. We can fix that. Do you have your account number handy, or I can look it up by name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By name please. Margaret Sherman. [pause] Wait, one moment, I am going to pass a truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] the engine is very loud when I go faster, sorry. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little roar in the background, but I've got you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I also want paperless. No more paper bill. Email only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I found your account, Margaret. So the new mailing address is what? Even if you go paperless, we like to have a good mailing address on file for notices."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good idea. I will give you. [line breaks up] ...you hear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. Can you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. The mailing address should be same as the house, the property. Not my mother. Just the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the bill goes to the property address instead of your mom's place. I'll update that. And for paperless, I'll need an email for you. Is it yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mine, yes. But my daughter also help me with the bills. She is better with computer. She want to be authorized, so she can talk to you for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Usually we need you to authorize her on the account. Since you're driving, the easiest way is for you to put it in writing, a short signed note with her name and that she can discuss the account. Or you can both come to the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:58:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Writing. Can you also put the explanation in writing? What you say now, for me. I do not want to forget. Last time the person said one thing and then another."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll make a note on the account and send you a summary once the paperless is set up. It'll cover the address change, the paperless switch, and what we need for your daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Because I did not get the last bill, I think maybe it is late now. Is there a late charge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. [pause] There's a balance showing from the last billing period. Late charges can happen when a bill goes unpaid, but since it went to the wrong address, you can ask for it to be reviewed. I'll note that on the account too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please note. It is not my mistake. I tell the office about address before, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't see that in the notes, but I'll flag it. Now, what's the email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will spell. M-S-H-E-R... [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I lost you after S-H-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I am stopping at the light now. It is quieter. I will say again slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, go ahead whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for patient. I will send the email instead, with my daughter name, so no mistake. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works fine. Send it to the utilities billing contact on the city website, and put your name and the property address in it. I'll note it here so we match it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Tony. Have a good Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Margaret. Drive safe."
    }
  ],
